  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "SEND A THANK YOU TO THE EDUCATORS IN YOUR LIFE.\n\nEducators at every level are heading back into long days, full classrooms, and everything that comes with a new school year.\n\nWe are making it easy to show up for them in the sweetest way ever.\n\nWe’re inviting you to sponsor a dozen (or a few) for a local school’s teacher break room.\n\nHere’s how it works:\n \n* Order your educator cookie order at the discounted price of $50 per dozen.\n* For Local Durham, NC Schools, leave the school in the comments and select pickup. \n* For all other school systems shipping, select shipping. \n* We’ll deliver or ship your cookies straight to their break room\n\nIt’s a simple way to say “we see you” to an entire team of educators at once.\n\nPerfect if you:\n\n* Have a child starting school\n* Want to support your old school\n* Just believe educators deserve something sweet during the chaos\n\nWe’ll be sharing photo updates of the deliveries via social media each week, so you can see the impact in real time. \n\nFirst deliveries will be made 8.3.2026, and will continue all school year as orders come in.\n\nSend cookies. Make someone’s day and support local.\n\n- Ashleigh"
    ],
